{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "source_image_sha256": "588b4288e4c737dc489d2b9bc0652cca85e3d668b1784942ef4b4bda916f1005",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "chapter": 77,
      "source": "ADV/DAT/CHAPTER077.YBC",
      "sha256": "67768f62b89cde853563e21a60babbb6e12e2f0047b5301fd100d7d7f5bdbdc3",
      "text_count": 67,
      "pages": [
        {
          "chapter": 77,
          "source_offset": 110,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            0
          ],
          "text": "咕哇～～～"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 77,
          "source_offset": 148,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            1
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 77,
          "source_offset": 182,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            2
          ],
          "text": "怎麼了？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 77,
          "source_offset": 222,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            3,
            4
          ],
          "text": "為什麼妳會這麼喜歡泡澡呢？\n我有點感興趣。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 77,
          "source_offset": 250,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            5,
            6
          ],
          "text": "雖然是公主殿下，\n不過好像也沒有那麼注重外表嘛。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 77,
          "source_offset": 284,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            7
          ],
          "text": "我～說～呀～"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 77,
          "source_offset": 306,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            8
          ],
          "text": "「沐浴」，也可是重要的修行咧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 77,
          "source_offset": 340,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            9
          ],
          "text": "那就當作是這樣吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 77,
          "source_offset": 374,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            10
          ],
          "text": "唔～～～"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 77,
          "source_offset": 408,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            11
          ],
          "text": "不過呢。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 77,
          "source_offset": 442,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            12
          ],
          "text": "嗯？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 77,
          "source_offset": 482,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            13,
            14
          ],
          "text": "本來還在這裡的人，現在都不在了，\n還真是寂寞呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 77,
          "source_offset": 516,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            15
          ],
          "text": "唉～呀～"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 77,
          "source_offset": 556,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            16,
            17
          ],
          "text": "因為有老師在、有帕彌菈學姊在，\n有老老師教導我們……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 77,
          "source_offset": 584,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            18,
            19
          ],
          "text": "純潔之盾的一切，\n我原本以為都已經步上了正軌。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 77,
          "source_offset": 610,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            20
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 77,
          "source_offset": 650,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            21,
            22
          ],
          "text": "但是仍然有一些小事情，\n一些不容易發現的事情。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 77,
          "source_offset": 678,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            23,
            24
          ],
          "text": "就像瑟希莉絲心中的不安，\n就是我們沒有辦法輕易發現的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 77,
          "source_offset": 704,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            25
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 77,
          "source_offset": 738,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            26
          ],
          "text": "也許那對預知能力的不安……正在萌芽。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 77,
          "source_offset": 760,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            27
          ],
          "text": "正在刺痛著瑟希莉絲的心也說不定。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 77,
          "source_offset": 794,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            28
          ],
          "text": "……所以啦。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 77,
          "source_offset": 816,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            29
          ],
          "text": "所以她才會離開的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 77,
          "source_offset": 842,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            30
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 77,
          "source_offset": 882,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            31,
            32
          ],
          "text": "會這樣撒嬌的人，\n想要逃避現實也不是不可能的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 77,
          "source_offset": 904,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            33
          ],
          "text": "但是呢……這樣也沒有什麼不好。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 77,
          "source_offset": 936,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            34,
            35
          ],
          "text": "至少比在撒嬌的時候，\n儘管只有一點點也好。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 77,
          "source_offset": 958,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            36
          ],
          "text": "多少也進步了一點。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 77,
          "source_offset": 986,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            37,
            38
          ],
          "text": "那些曾經讓她依賴過的人，\n一定也會感到很欣慰吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 77,
          "source_offset": 1020,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            39
          ],
          "text": "……是呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 77,
          "source_offset": 1054,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            40
          ],
          "text": "她的未來，一定會開出美麗的花朵……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 77,
          "source_offset": 1088,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            41
          ],
          "text": "嗯嗯，我也是這麼希望的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 77,
          "source_offset": 1114,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            42
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 77,
          "source_offset": 1140,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            43
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 77,
          "source_offset": 1174,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            44
          ],
          "text": "要起來了？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 77,
          "source_offset": 1208,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            45
          ],
          "text": "不。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 77,
          "source_offset": 1242,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            46
          ],
          "text": "……這可真是稀奇了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 77,
          "source_offset": 1276,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            47
          ],
          "text": "瑟希莉絲正在努力著。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 77,
          "source_offset": 1298,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            48
          ],
          "text": "我也想稍微再多努力一下。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 77,
          "source_offset": 1332,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            49
          ],
          "text": "這真是令人害怕呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 77,
          "source_offset": 1360,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            50,
            51
          ],
          "text": "在這種簡直就要結冰～的冷水浴裡面，\n為什麼還要忍耐下去咧？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 77,
          "source_offset": 1394,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            52
          ],
          "text": "……經妳這麼一說，妳的嘴唇都已經紫了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 77,
          "source_offset": 1428,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            53
          ],
          "text": "我也再多陪妳待一會兒吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 77,
          "source_offset": 1450,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            54
          ],
          "text": "因為只不過是想像一下，就已經很興奮了呢。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 77,
          "source_offset": 1484,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            55
          ],
          "text": "？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 77,
          "source_offset": 1518,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            56
          ],
          "text": "會來溫柔包裹我冰冷的身體……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 77,
          "source_offset": 1540,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            57
          ],
          "text": "會來幫忙我的……是老師嗎？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 77,
          "source_offset": 1562,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            58
          ],
          "text": "還是說……是艾爾雪呢？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 77,
          "source_offset": 1588,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            59
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 77,
          "source_offset": 1622,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            60
          ],
          "text": "對吧？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 77,
          "source_offset": 1644,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            61
          ],
          "text": "不管是哪一種情況，都讓人心跳加速對吧☆"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 77,
          "source_offset": 1678,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            62
          ],
          "text": "別擔心。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 77,
          "source_offset": 1700,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            63
          ],
          "text": "到時候我會好好地去溫暖妳的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 77,
          "source_offset": 1734,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            64
          ],
          "text": "真的！？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 77,
          "source_offset": 1768,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            65
          ],
          "text": "當然。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 77,
          "source_offset": 1790,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            66
          ],
          "text": "就把妳丟進沸騰的溫泉裡啊。"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "chapter": 231,
      "source": "ADV/DAT/CHAPTER231.YBC",
      "sha256": "3e74bddf4c6eef7ac4af57d91f6e96aac4bfa530191539f9e32f3d334da0ea84",
      "text_count": 43,
      "pages": [
        {
          "chapter": 231,
          "source_offset": 98,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            0
          ],
          "text": "黑衣施咒者已經困住了不動的橋墩。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 231,
          "source_offset": 158,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            1,
            2,
            3,
            4
          ],
          "text": "他們配合著「匍伏蔓延而來之物」展開了行動\n嗎？\n……或者是說，葛斯貝布洛真正的實力，\n已經衰落到這種地步了嗎？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 231,
          "source_offset": 190,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            5,
            6
          ],
          "text": "那是因為他們的對手，\n不是簡單用刀劍就可以對抗的吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 231,
          "source_offset": 222,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            7,
            8
          ],
          "text": "是施展著超強魔法的敵人嗎？\n還是實力超乎想像的混沌騎士呢？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 231,
          "source_offset": 248,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            9
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 231,
          "source_offset": 270,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            10
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 231,
          "source_offset": 322,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            11,
            12,
            13,
            14
          ],
          "text": "如同火炎之長所說的，\n他們是不能逃避的對手。\n就算要與四大學級交手，\n他們也不會有絲毫的遲疑吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 231,
          "source_offset": 348,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            15
          ],
          "text": "嗯嗯。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 231,
          "source_offset": 380,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            16,
            17
          ],
          "text": "我想，\n純潔之盾還是得去完成自己能夠做到的事情。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 231,
          "source_offset": 406,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            18
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 231,
          "source_offset": 432,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            19
          ],
          "text": "我們已經為了要幫助別人而鍛鍊自己很久了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 231,
          "source_offset": 458,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            20
          ],
          "text": "而且現在也的確有人在等待我們的援救……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 231,
          "source_offset": 490,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            21,
            22
          ],
          "text": "如果今天我們對這件事情坐視不管的話，\n那麼以後可能就得這樣一直袖手旁觀下去了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 231,
          "source_offset": 512,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            23
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 231,
          "source_offset": 540,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            24,
            25
          ],
          "text": "嗯嗯，我能理解。\n打從一開始我就不打算要阻止你。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 231,
          "source_offset": 566,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            26
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 231,
          "source_offset": 598,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            27,
            28
          ],
          "text": "不過，要順著帕蘭達因的意思去做事，\n還真是令人嚥不下這口氣呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 231,
          "source_offset": 624,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            29
          ],
          "text": "不是這樣的，羅弗利先生……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 231,
          "source_offset": 650,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            30
          ],
          "text": "？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 231,
          "source_offset": 682,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            31,
            32
          ],
          "text": "無論如何，\n這也是純潔之盾自己做的決定呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 231,
          "source_offset": 714,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            33,
            34
          ],
          "text": "……嗯嗯，這樣啊。\n的確是這樣沒錯。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 231,
          "source_offset": 736,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            35
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 231,
          "source_offset": 758,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            36
          ],
          "text": "羅弗利……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 231,
          "source_offset": 790,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            37,
            38
          ],
          "text": "不用在意我的想法。\n你們只要好好地把事情做好就好。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 231,
          "source_offset": 822,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            39,
            40
          ],
